B.aeE=s(["Initiative: define one small, clear first step toward a new goal.","Preparation: fill information or supply gaps and make a calm plan.","Learning: set aside a short lesson, reading or research session.","Comparison: weigh your options against clear criteria before deciding.","Resources: review your budget, shopping list and what you already have.","Communication: prepare an agenda for an important meeting or appointment.","Effort: break a long task into small, steady steps.","Care: tidy your home or workspace and make room for a quiet pause.","Visibility: refresh a presentation, portfolio or profile.","Creativity: make time for a new draft, idea or prototype.","Organization: reorder your task list and calendar realistically.","Boundaries: set one clear limit to protect your time and energy.","Cooperation: ask for feedback or clarify a shared plan.","Focus: reduce distractions and finish one important task.","Simplify: clear unused items, open tasks or unnecessary spending.","Balance: check for fairness in spending, workload and relationships.","Strategy: write down your goal and terms before a negotiation or key talk.","Depth: make space for a difficult conversation or focused research.","Resolve: change an ineffective method while keeping the goal in view.","Harvest: record completed work and assess its practical results.","Rest: leave space in your schedule before taking on another commitment.","Skill: choose one short, practical exercise to improve a task.","Completion: finish an open task or clarify what needs to be handed over.","Refinement: make one small change to a routine to sustain it better.","Innovation: test a new tool or method on a small scale first.","Sharing: divide resources, knowledge or responsibilities fairly.","Review: note one lesson from the decisions you made recently.","Renewal: rest your mind and set a simple intention for the next cycle."],t.s)
